VALIDATION FLOW
================================================================================

Submit
  ↓
preventDefault()
  ↓
validateForm()
  ↓
+---------------------------+
|                           |
Errors                    Valid
|                           |
↓                           ↓
setErrors()              setErrors({})
|                           |
↓                           ↓
Render Errors            Process Form
