================================================================================
ERROR CLEARING BEHAVIOR
================================================================================

Suppose:

errors.email

=
'Email is required'


User starts editing email:

handleChange()


Then:

errors.email

can be cleared.


IMPORTANT:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Clearing an error when typing does NOT necessarily mean the new value is valid.

It only means:

"Remove the old message while the user is correcting the field."


Another valid UX approach is:

REVALIDATE THAT FIELD ON CHANGE/BLUR.


